	{l s='Sips is the international, multichannel secure payment solution provided by Worldline, the leader in e-payment transactional services in France and throughout Europe.' mod='worldline'}
<br>
	{l s='With a single integration, this module gives you access to functionalities like:' mod='worldline'}
	<br><br>

	<ul style='list-style-type:circle;'>
		<li>{l s='Accepting multiple payment methods with one module.' mod='worldline'}</li>
		<li>{l s='Localizing your payment page with multiple languages and currencies.' mod='worldline'}</li>
		<li>{l s='Completing transactions when orders are confirmed.' mod='worldline'}</li>
		<li>{l s='Splitting payments into (up to 4) installments, without added fees.' mod='worldline'}</li>
		<li>{l s='3D Secured payments (set by order total).' mod='worldline'}</li>
	</ul>
